# Zolto User Manual

> Welcome to the User Manual. Use this guide to set up, configure, and master Zolto 10.0.0.

---

## 1. Quick Setup Checklist

@tasks {
  [ ] Install Zolto CLI (`npm i -g zolto`)
  [ ] Initialize workspace (`zolto init`)
  [ ] Create first `.zl` document
  [ ] Compile document (`zolto build`)
}

---

## 2. Keyboard Shortcuts

| Action | Windows / Linux | macOS |
| :----- | :-------------- | :---- |
| Save Document | [[Ctrl+S]] | [[Cmd+S]] |
| Toggle Preview | [[Ctrl+P]] | [[Cmd+P]] |
| Insert Vector Block | [[Ctrl+Shift+V]] | [[Cmd+Shift+V]] |
| Insert Interactive Form | [[Ctrl+Shift+I]] | [[Cmd+Shift+I]] |

---

## 3. Frequently Asked Questions & Troubleshooting

@accordion {
  @section "How do I define reusable components?"
  Use the Phase 9 keyword syntax:
  ```zolto
  component Card(title="")
    ### {title}
    slot
    end
  end
  ```
  @/section

  @section "Is client-side JavaScript required for interactive elements?"
  No! All Phase 10 interactive widgets compile to native, semantic, accessible HTML with `data-zl-*` attributes for optional progressive enhancement.
  @/section

  @section "How do I report bugs or request features?"
  Visit our official repository issue tracker at `github.com/uxle/zolto`.
  @/section
}
